  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-394-435">なたねなの花は川邊にさけど</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-435-449">遠望の雪</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-449-481">午後の日に消えやらず</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-481-513">寂しく麥の芽をふみて</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-513-544">高き煉瓦の下を行く</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-544-576">ひとり路上に坐りつつ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-576-593">怒りに燃え</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-593-599">この</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-599-623"><rb>故郷</rb><rt>ふるさと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-623-649">をのがれいでむと</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-649-681">土に小石を投げあつる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-681-707">監獄署裏の林より</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-707-739">鶫ひねもす鳴き鳴けり</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-739-790" style="padding-inline-start: 10em">
        <p><seg source="#source-763-790">（滯郷哀語篇より）</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
